{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">2021 Fall AMC 10B #5</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12B #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_3_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 3 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcbb1829cfd3910fb9ae5b3b7a33669743a0635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=8^{2022}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />. Which of the following is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fdeb0520d0696dd2ecc0bd866de5f7a72f60a74e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{4}?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"25\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/2/822343041d147948275a55f5903eff98edfae460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\: 4^{1010}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)} \\: 2^{2022}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)} \\: 8^{2018}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)} \\: 4^{3031}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)} \\: 4^{3032}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"480\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8f511842bf3275a1d48df6d5f8adcd18102756.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=8^{2022}=  \\left(8^\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{3033}=4^{3033}.\\]\" width=\"227\" height=\"35\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44cf34fd04107d751424dd4df3f40daae9b744e1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n}4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\: 4^{3032}}.\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"33\" />\n~kingofpineapplz\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The requested value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/8/7d81ce2dc12bcdcd5021c0d085e79c9f61a4ce52.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8^{2022}}{4} = \\frac{2^{6066}}{4} = \\frac{2^{6066}}{2^2} = 2^{6064} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\: 4^{3032}}.\\]\" width=\"335\" height=\"39\" />\n~NH14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we rewrite everything in powers of 2, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbf748bde9c676af6c1b7d0b7c217bef5d9690b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8^{2022} = (2^{3})^{2022} = 2^{6064} = (4^{\\frac{1}{2}})^{6064} = 4^{\\frac{6064}{2}} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\: 4^{3032}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"471\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>- abed_nadir (youtube.com/@indianmathguy)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e2112c3ff071ec02890d341a7b2c9a59a911eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8^{2022}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/078f521d1cc133a1a9c0254cf16d75564378b95b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${8^{2022}}/{4} = 2 * 8^{2021} = 2 * 2^{6063} = 2^{6064} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\: 4^{3032}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"399\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>-sphericalfox\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=429\">https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=429</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Just_3_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Just_3_min!)\">Video Solution (Just 3 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Just 3 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/480KnrVnbOc\">https://youtu.be/480KnrVnbOc</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/iXX4WtMKU_g\">https://youtu.be/iXX4WtMKU_g</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lC7naDZ1Eu4?t=882\">https://youtu.be/lC7naDZ1Eu4?t=882</a>\n</p><p>For AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/yaE5aAmeesc?t=590\">https://youtu.be/yaE5aAmeesc?t=590</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B\">2021 Fall AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki